  ],
  "senses": [
    {
      "zh": "像……一样；如同"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The food in Shanghai is not "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "as"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " hot "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "as"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " that in Sichuan."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "上海的食物不像四川的食物那么辣。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "as…as 是常考词组，常出现在保持句意基本不变的句型转换练习中，所以学生一定要掌握其用法："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "A is not as/so + 形容词的原级 as B = B is + 形容词的比较级 than A。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：The traffic in the countryside "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "is not as/so convenient as"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " that in the city."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= The traffic in the city "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "is more convenient than"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " that in the countryside."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "城市的交通比农村的交通方便。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Australia "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "doesn’t have as many people as"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " China."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= Australia "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "has fewer people than"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " China."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "= China "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "has more people than"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Australia."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "澳大利亚的人口比中国的少。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
